//www.nite.go.jp/nbrc/catalogue/NBRCMediumDetailServlet?NO=1601\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 40\nL0: 【0†NBRC Online Catalogue】\nL1: \nL2:   * 【1†Search Menu】\nL3: \nL4: 【0†NBRC Culture Catalogue Search】 【2†Homology Search】 【3†Sequence Search】\nL5: \nL6: ## Search Results Detail\nL7: ### Medium Detail Information\nL8: Medium No.  | 1601\nL9: Medium  | Medium for nitrite oxidizer\nL10: Composition\nL11: ---\nL12: NaNO_{2} 49.2-98.6 mg\nL13: K_{2}HPO_{4} 25.4 mg\nL14: MgSO_{4}·7H_{2}O 40.6 mg\nL15: CaCl_{2}·2H_{2}O 6.6 mg\nL16: FeSO_{4}·7H_{2}O 3.2 mg\nL17: NaHCO_{3} 200 mg\nL18: MnSO_{4}·5H_{2}O 54.2 μg\nL19: H_{3}BO_{3} 49.4 μg\nL20: ZnSO_{4}·7H_{2}O 43.1 μg\nL21: Na_{2}Mo_{4}O_{4} 27.6 μg\nL22: CuSO_{4}·5H_{2}O 25.0 μg\nL23: Distilled water 1 L\nL24: Mix ingregients except NaNO_{2}, K_{2}HPO_{4}, MgSO_{4}·7H_{2}O, CaCl_{2}·2H_{2}O, FeSO_{4}·7H_{2}O, and NaHCO_{3}, dispense the medium into suitable culture vessels, and autoclave (121°C, 20min). NaNO_{2}, K_{2}HPO_{4}, MgSO_{4}·7H_{2}O, CaCl_{2}·2H_{2}O are autoclaved separately, and added to the medium. Filter-sterile FeSO_{4}·7H_{2}O and NaHCO_{3} solutions are added to the medium. Final pH is 7.8-8.3.\nL25: Comment  |\nL26: ### About Us\nL27: \nL28:   * 【4†About NITE】\nL29:   * 【5†About NBRC】\nL30:   * 【6†About this website】\nL31:   * 【7†Terms of service】\nL32:   * 【7†Privacy Policy】\nL33:   * 【8†Disclaimer】\nL34: \nL35: ### Contact\nL36: \nL37:   * 【9†Culture Collection Division】\nL38: \nL39: Copyright © National Institute of Technology and Evaluation. All rights reserved.\n"
